        "intro": {
          "type": "brand_text",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Intro",
            "content": "<p>Panquire sells electric motorcycles and off-road electric dirt bikes. Explore the <a href=\"/products/t-01\">T-01</a> and <a href=\"/products/t-02\">T-02</a> for recreational off-road riding or the <a href=\"/products/t-03\">T-03 mini electric motorcycle</a>. For help choosing a model or with an existing order, <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact Panquire support</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "story": {
          "type": "brand_text",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Story",
            "content": "<p>We started Panquire in 2018 to fill the gap between budget and premium electric motorcycles. Before that, we were just a bunch of businesspeople who liked the novelty, affordability, and style of electric motorcycles. Most of us had one for the street and one for the trail. We bought inexpensive bikes and upgraded most of them ourselves. Even with the extra work, that made more sense to us than spending a fortune on a high-end bike from Sur-Ron or Stark Future. But what was out there for riders who wanted a bike they could ride as it came and a price somewhere in the middle? That question led us to design our own electric motorcycle. We wanted to build the kind of bike riders like us had been looking for. We spent a lot of time riding trails, so the T-01 and T-02 electric dirt bikes were the first models we made. We wanted to make it easier for teens and adults to afford their first off-road bike while not compromising on power and battery. We made the T-03 for people who prefer riding on city streets. We wanted them to have a lightweight electric motorcycle with the speed and build quality they liked in higher-end bikes at a price they could afford. Especially in this state of the world economy, we’re proud to say that Panquire was started by middle-class riders, for middle-class riders.</p>"
          }
        },
        "engineering": {
          "type": "brand_text",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Engineering",
            "content": "<p>From the frame and suspension to the motor, battery, brakes, and controls, we put thousands of decisions into the design and engineering of every bike so you do not have to think about them once you start riding.</p>"
          }
        },
        "purpose": {
          "type": "brand_text",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Purpose",
            "content": "<p>We have been on both sides of that experience, and that is exactly why Panquire exists.</p>"
          }
        },
